@title STORY • ALEXA: THE ONES WHO STAYED
@bg art_studio_night
You're Alexa Carter. The art building is empty after 10 p.m. That's the only reason you draw here.
Your sketchbook is full of people who don't know they're in it. London mid-argument. Maggie laughing. Paris asleep on the bus. And Zane. A lot of Zane. Too much Zane.
Your phone buzzes. Mom: "your dad and I are proud of you. call us sunday? <3"
Your dad's from Oregon. Your mom's from Atlanta. Growing up, people always asked you "what are you." You learned early that being quiet meant fewer questions.
> [Sweet] Call your mom right now. -> a1
> [Good] Text back "sunday <3" and keep drawing. -> a2
*a1
@add Family 3
Mom: Baby! Why are you up? Are you drawing? You sound like you're drawing.
Alexa: How can I SOUND like I'm drawing?
Mom: A mother knows.
You talk for an hour. You draw her from memory while you do.
@jump a_done
*a2
@add Art 2
You draw until 1 a.m. Your hand cramps. It's the best you've felt all week.
*a_done
@bg track_stadium_day
@show coachrhodes
Coach Rhodes: CARTER! Let's GO! That was a PR! Why aren't you SCREAMING?
Alexa: I'm... happy on the inside, Coach.
Coach Rhodes: Inside? Girl, put it on the OUTSIDE! Zane! Show her how!
@show zane
Zane: (leaping off the mat, screaming) ALEXA CARTER, EVERYBODY! CLEARED IT LIKE IT OWED HER MONEY!
The entire jumps group cheers. Your face is on fire.
> [Bold] Scream back. Loud. For once. -> b1
> [Sweet] Hide your face in your hands, smiling. -> b2
> [Good] Nod. Say "thanks." Go back to the pit. -> b3
*b1
@add Confidence 3
@add Alexa_Zane 2
You scream. It comes out cracked and weird. Coach Rhodes nearly cries. Zane looks at you like you just cleared six meters.
@jump b_done
*b2
@add Alexa_Zane 2
Zane: (walking over, quieter) Too much? I can scream less.
Alexa: (through your fingers) Don't scream less.
@jump b_done
*b3
Coach Rhodes: (sighing) We'll get there, Carter. We'll get there.
*b_done
@bg campus_quad_night
@show paris
Paris: Lex. Who's the boy on page forty-two?
She's holding your sketchbook. You left it on the bus.
> [Sweet] "...You already know who." -> c1
> [Bold] Snatch it back. "Nobody." -> c2
> [Good] "Can you keep a secret?" -> c3
*c1
@add Paris_Friendship 3
Paris: (hugging the sketchbook) I KNEW IT. Alexa. This is the most romantic thing I've ever seen. You drew his EYELASHES.
@jump end
*c2
Paris: (grinning) Nobody has really nice eyelashes.
@jump end
*c3
@add Paris_Friendship 2
Paris: Better than anyone. I've kept one since I was six.
You both know exactly who she means. You sit on the quad and keep each other's secrets until the sprinklers come on.
*end
Alexa Carter sees everything and says almost nothing. This year, she's learning that the people she draws might want to see themselves the way she sees them.
